OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US announces new tariffs on some of
OL,7,Fits biggest trade partners, including
OL,8,FChina and the European Union
OL,10,FDifferent tariffs will apply to
OL,11,Fdifferent countries and products -
OL,12,FChina is facing the highest rate of "up
OL,13,Fto 40%"
OL,15,FA handful of countries face a rate of
OL,16,F"up to 25%", including Thailand and
OL,17,FIndia, while Japan and others face "up
OL,18,Fto 20%" - the UK is not included in the
OL,19,Flist
