OL,3,AUS announces new tariff proposals on
OL,4,AEU, China, and other trade partners
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut our business reporter says the
OL,7,Factual rates paid will be far lower due
OL,8,Fto trade deals Donald Trump has struck
OL,9,Fwith many countries
OL,11,FThe US president has repeatedly
OL,12,Fthreatened or imposed tariffs during
OL,13,Fhis second term, arguing they'll boost
OL,14,FAmerican manufacturing and create jobs
OL,16,FThese latest proposals come after the
OL,17,FSupreme Court ruled this year that
OL,18,Fprevious tariffs imposed by Trump were
OL,19,Fillegally enacted
